        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-7",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Anxiety and mood symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Long history of on-and-off anxiety and low moods. Anxiety increased over 6 months, especially at work; feels on edge all day and wiped out afterward. Mood described as up and down, irritable and tearful at home. Avoiding friends because too drained."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-8",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-8",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Sleep"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Poor sleep with reduced sleep onset and waking at 3–4 am with mind racing about school; approximately 4–5 hours of broken sleep."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-9",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-9",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Brief periods of increased energy and productivity"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Brief 1–2 day spells of feeling “pumped and super productive” with decreased need for sleep, while still functioning; no risky behavior and no clear mania."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-10",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-10",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Perception and thoughts about others"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "No auditory or visual hallucinations. Occasionally feels staff are talking about her but recognizes this is likely anxiety."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-11",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-11",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Sensory sensitivities and behavior when overwhelmed"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Reports sensitivity to noise and lights, routines, and “meltdowns” at home when overwhelmed, involving pacing, raised voice, and slamming doors; no violence."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-12",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-12",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Suicidal ideation and self-harm"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Denies current or past suicidal ideation or self-harm; states, “I’m not suicidal just exhausted.”"
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-13",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-13",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Alcohol, drugs, and caffeine"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Reports no drug use and alcohol intake of 0–2 standard drinks per week. Drinks 4–5 coffees daily."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-14",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-14",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Work impact"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Worried about her job and finding it harder to cope; occasionally takes sick days for anxiety or sleep."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-15",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-15",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Mental status examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Well kempt, mildly restless, anxious affect, mood “tired and stressed”; thought process logical but circumstantial; no psychosis; no suicidal or homicidal ideation; insight okay and judgment intact."
      }
